  "title": "Apple and Amazon Launch New Smart Home Devices",
  "summary": "Apple is set to launch its smart home devices, including a lock, doorbell, thermostat, and indoor camera, at an October 13 event in New York. Amazon is set to debut new Alexa devices like the Alexa Photo Frame and Echo Time smart clock, alongside other upgraded features. The reports highlight Apple's focus on AI-powered home automation and Amazon's expansion of AI-based smart devices.",
